WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.421
One of the first things I
remember just making so much

00:00:04.421 --> 00:00:09.426
of a stunning impression
on me as a kid was Cher.

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:14.681
You don't know me.

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:20.729
I just did not understand
who or what she was

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:23.064
other than magnificent.

00:00:23.064 --> 00:00:26.484
Growing up, watching
Cher and her trajectory,

00:00:26.484 --> 00:00:29.320
beautiful and magnificent as she was on

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:30.864
The Sonny and Cher Show,

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:32.115
and then when
she went on

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:33.533
to do her 
own show.

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:36.745
She just had these clothes,

00:00:36.745 --> 00:00:40.498
which later I learned, they
were Bob Mackie designs,

00:00:40.498 --> 00:00:43.752
and just blew me away.

00:00:43.752 --> 00:00:47.130
And she continues to blow us away.

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:50.925
I used to really love snowboarding.

00:00:50.925 --> 00:00:54.054
So they told me, "Why don't
you try snowboarding?"

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:56.765
I was a little gun shy, but
I said, "Let me try it."

00:00:58.391 --> 00:00:59.851
I got it. I was out there.

00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:01.811
You know, I'm from LA, you can skateboard.

00:01:01.811 --> 00:01:03.146
Went back the next time,

00:01:03.146 --> 00:01:05.482
maybe two or three
years later, still good.

00:01:06.274 --> 00:01:10.236
Maybe about seven years
ago, went back out there,

00:01:11.488 --> 00:01:12.363
took a spill.

00:01:12.363 --> 00:01:15.992
Oh, I feel the pain
right now in this moment.

00:01:15.992 --> 00:01:20.413
One thing I could tell you guys
I will never ever do again,

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:22.957
even with a check involved, is snowboard.

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:25.835
I just love great storytelling.

00:01:25.835 --> 00:01:29.756
If it's a great story, I'm
still gonna show up for it.

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:34.052
There are some films
that I have watched over

00:01:34.052 --> 00:01:37.097
and over and over again
and still to this day.

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:39.682
The Godfather, part one.

00:01:39.682 --> 00:01:41.392
I know that that's, you know,

00:01:41.392 --> 00:01:43.436
an argument for a lot of people,

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:44.896
part one versus two.

00:01:44.896 --> 00:01:47.607
Part one. Just no, it's
not an argument, no.

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:50.193
Part one. 
The Godfather.

00:01:50.193 --> 00:01:53.238
And Coming to America,

00:01:53.655 --> 00:01:55.824
still watch it over and over to this day.

00:01:56.116 --> 00:01:57.033
Damn right.

00:01:57.033 --> 00:01:59.160
That's the beauty of storytelling.

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:01.329
Sally Field

00:02:01.329 --> 00:02:05.083
inspired me to want to become an actress.

00:02:05.083 --> 00:02:08.962
At a young age, what
she did

00:02:08.962 --> 00:02:10.088
with Norma Rae

00:02:10.088 --> 00:02:14.759
and what she did with
Sybil was just mindblowing

00:02:14.759 --> 00:02:17.804
that that was the same human being.

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:20.765
I was so young with Norma Rae

00:02:20.765 --> 00:02:24.978
that I really didn't
understand it probably fully

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:28.356
until I got a little older
and got to see it again.

00:02:28.356 --> 00:02:28.690
And then–

00:02:33.736 --> 00:02:35.196
Still to this day.

00:02:35.196 --> 00:02:38.741
I want to make people feel

00:02:38.741 --> 00:02:41.369
the way she makes me feel

00:02:41.369 --> 00:02:44.747
or the way I felt when I saw those films.

00:02:44.747 --> 00:02:48.668
I take the moment in, just
like when I was a kid, now.

00:02:48.668 --> 00:02:50.962
Just seeing that brings me joy.

00:02:50.962 --> 00:02:52.213
It's joy in everything.

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:55.216
Check out
The Harder They Fall,

00:02:55.216 --> 00:02:57.302
only on Netflix.

